    "body": "Hi! BlenderKit rebranded to **Blendkit** in June 2026 and its website moved from `www.blenderkit.com` to `www.blendkit.com`.\n\nThis PR only updates the link domain(s) — the old domain 301-redirects, so nothing is broken today, but direct links are faster and future-proof for your readers. No other content changes.\n\nThanks for linking to us!\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
