    "body": "Hello, I’d like to use it to generate my own dataset, but I’m stuck at the “Generate outdoor data” step. The “humanoid models (e.g., from BlenderKit and Mixamo)” you mentioned—does that correspond to the “character” in the code? I noticed BlenderKit and Mixamo assets are saved as .fbx rather than .blend. Do I need to import the .fbx into Blender and then save them as .blend?",
