    "body": "Hi Zheng Yang,\n\nThank you for your excellent work! I noticed that you’ve released the rendered annotations of PointOdyssey, I’m wondering if it would be possible to also release the raw scenes?\n\nAlso, could you share the approximate time cost ratio between _generating the scenes_ and _rendering the annotations_?\n\nThanks again!",
