      "blocking": 0,
      "total_blocking": 0
    },
    "body": "Hello,\n\nThank you so much for making the amazing work public! I was going through the project page which mentions:\n\n\"For a subset of the scenes, we include multiple synchronized views.\"\n\nI was wondering if there are more details available about which specific scenes include these synchronized views? I downloaded the sample data but couldn't find any labels, metadata, or documentation indicating whether a scene contains synchronized views or not.\n\nThanks in advance!",
