    },
    "body": "Hi,\n\nIn the released segmentation maps, would you know what semantic category or asset each of the segmentation labels correspond to?\n\nBased on https://github.com/y-zheng18/point_odyssey/blob/a053342a72fed32af4134b4ca0c44a78a3ac0fdb/utils/openexr_utils.py#L175, it seems that it might be based on the order of assets provided to the generation script, but I wasn't sure where to find this (or the segmentation ID:mapping) in the released dataset.\n\nThanks!\nSkanda",
