    "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/y-zheng18/point_odyssey",
    "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/y-zheng18/point_odyssey/issues/20/labels{/name}",
    "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/y-zheng18/point_odyssey/issues/20/comments",
    "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/y-zheng18/point_odyssey/issues/20/events",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/y-zheng18/point_odyssey/issues/20",
    "id": 2767486441,
    "node_id": "I_kwDOJ6JElM6k9H3p",
    "number": 20,
    "title": "Inconsistent Handling of `valid` Values in `test_on_pod.py` and `pointodysseydataset_fullseq.py`",
    "user": {
      "login": "EricLina",
      "id": 60723818,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzIzODE4",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60723818?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/EricLina",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "labels": [

    ],
    "state": "closed",
    "locked": false,
    "assignees": [

    ],
    "milestone": null,
    "comments": 0,
    "created_at": "2025-01-03T12:20:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-03T12:20:34Z",
    "closed_at": "2025-01-03T12:20:34Z",
    "assignee": null,
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "active_lock_reason": null,
    "sub_issues_summary": {
      "total": 0,
      "completed": 0,
      "percent_completed": 0
    },
    "issue_dependencies_summary": {
      "blocked_by": 0,
      "total_blocked_by": 0,
      "blocking": 0,
      "total_blocking": 0
    },
    "body": "#### **Issue Description**:\r\n\r\nI've noticed that in the two code files, `test_on_pod.py` and `pointodysseydataset_fullseq.py`, the `valid` variable is handled inconsistently:\r\n[pips2/test_on_pod.py at 8b5bd9ecb27274f76f75fcaeff0dbdf13de0b977 · aharley/pips2](https://github.com/aharley/pips2/blob/8b5bd9ecb27274f76f75fcaeff0dbdf13de0b977/test_on_pod.py#L43)\r\n* In `test_on_pod.py`, the `valid` variable seems to be used directly and can contain both `True` and `False` values, which is potentially problematic since it is assumed that it should be strictly `True`.\r\n\r\n[pips2/datasets/pointodysseydataset_fullseq.py at 8b5bd9ecb27274f76f75fcaeff0dbdf13de0b977 · aharley/pips2](https://github.com/aharley/pips2/blob/8b5bd9ecb27274f76f75fcaeff0dbdf13de0b977/datasets/pointodysseydataset_fullseq.py#L93)\r\n* In `pointodysseydataset_fullseq.py`, the `valids` variable is generated from the expression `valids = (visibs < 2).astype(np.float32)`. From my review of `visibs`, it only contains `True` and `False` values. This means that `valids` should also only contain `True` values, leading to a mismatch in expectations between these two files.\r\n\r\n#### **Question**: \r\n**Why is the `valid` variable being handled differently in these two locations?** Specifically, why is the `valid` variable in `test_on_pod.py` allowed to contain both `True` and `False` values, whereas in `pointodysseydataset_fullseq.py`, it is assumed to only contain `True` values?  Would it be possible to align the usage of `valid` across these files to ensure consistency?\r\n\r\nThanks in advance for your help!\r\n",
    "closed_by": {
      "login": "EricLina",
      "id": 60723818,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzIzODE4",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60723818?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/EricLina",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EricLina/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
