    "body": "Hi, and thanks for the simulation data release. As this issue https://github.com/y-zheng18/point_odyssey/issues/6 mentioned the wrong depth value of ground in outdoor scene dataset. Would you mind sharing what changes are made to let the simulation code generate correct depth value?   ",
