    },
    "body": "Hey, thank you for the great work! Would it be possible to render videos with motion blur (from both the camera and/or moving objects) similar to how the MOVi-f dataset is generated in kubric (https://github.com/google-research/kubric/blob/main/challenges/movi/README.md#movi-f)? Thanks in advance.",
