    "body": "Hi there! This work would be really useful in other domains such as [animation](https://lisiyao21.github.io/projects/AnimeRun). In this case it would be necessary to export toon rendered (line drawing) images.\r\n\r\nIs there any plan to release the blender project files? This would enable us to export different renders. I imagine others might want to do something similar.",
