    },
    "body": "Thanks for the great work! From what I gather from recent work in CoTracker (Table 4), training PIPS on Kubric instead of FlyingThings++ might already give a performance boost in point accuracy that is comparable to that of PointOdyssey. I'd be interested in learning more about how PIPS (or PIPS++) performs when trained on PointOdyssey compared to Kubric.\r\n\r\nCould you provide any insights or experimental results comparing these two training methods? Is there a clear advantage in using PointOdyssey over Kubric?\r\n",
